      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "boton-play",
      "description": "Acción principal del panel: círculo de 48 px en el color del día, entre anterior y siguiente.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-controles\"><button class=\"ds-ctrl\" aria-label=\"Anterior\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.5 5v14M18 5.5 9 12l9 6.5z\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-ctrl ds-play\" aria-label=\"Reproducir\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 5.5v13L18.5 12z\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-ctrl\" aria-label=\"Siguiente\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M17.5 5v14M6 5.5 15 12l-9 6.5z\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-controles{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.ds-ctrl{display:grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:40px;padding:0;border:none;border-radius:50%;background:none;color:#14213d;cursor:pointer}.ds-ctrl svg{width:19px;height:19px;fill:currentColor;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-ctrl:hover{background:rgba(20,33,61,.08)}.ds-play{width:48px;height:48px;background:#2453d1;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px color-mix(in srgb,#2453d1 40%,transparent)}.ds-play:hover{background:#1d44ad}.ds-play svg{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:none}.ds-ctrl:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid #2453d1;outline-offset:2px}"
